    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601203/2006012030090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012030100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "危ないことはしないでほしいな、というだけで──",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601203/2006012030100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012030110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "何か調べものがあったんだろう？\r\nそれはアナタが仕事に熱心だという証拠じゃないか",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601203/2006012030110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012030120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それのどこに、かっこ悪いところがあると言うんだい？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601203/2006012030120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あはは……\r\n咲耶にかかると俺がすごい人みたいに聞こえるな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012030130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そう思ってくれてかまわないんだよ、\r\nプロデューサー？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601203/2006012030130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012030140,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私の映像もいくつかあったみたいだけれど\r\n何を調べていたのかな？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601203/2006012030140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──え",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "autoWaitTime": 600
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012030150,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601203/2006012030150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……あ～……！\r\nそうか、上の方ってそれが──あー……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012030160,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "プロデューサー……？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601203/2006012030160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いやー……はは……！\r\nすまん、なんでもない。勝手に恥ずかしがってるだけだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "本人に見られちゃうなんて、またかっこつかないなって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012030170,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601203/2006012030170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶の今度の撮影にさ、何か使えるものがないか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006012030180,
